    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d622-a13">

                <pb facs="0737" n="651" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg651"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 13.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Naugle to Mr.
                            Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guaymas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your wire 24th. District court in Nogales has not yet been advised of Bonsall’s
                    sentence. Lie. Rafael Ycaza writes me from Mexico that Bonsall was sentenced to
                    eight months’ imprisonment, and same commuted to a fine. Have written him for
                    copy of sentence and will advise you later.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. A. Naugle.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
